------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
(1) masterTaperExp p   [ divRatio(m) = m^p ;  p = ln(R(m)/R(1.0)) / ln(m) ]
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
  m=0.25: R(m)/R(1.0) = 0.0575 = -24.81 dB  ->  p = 2.061
  m=0.75: R(m)/R(1.0) = 0.5059 = -5.92 dB  ->  p = 2.369  (both gain-n12 -> correction CANCELS, cleanest)
  => two estimates 2.061 / 2.369; PREFER the gain-n12-cancelling 0.75/1.0: p = 2.369  (mean 2.215)
  shipped interim was 1.43; A-taper pots typically p ~ 2-3. A pin-free interior value that
  both knobs agree on is the accept condition.

